    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow. Adapt. Symbiotize. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the vibrant, microscopic world of <strong>Primordial Empire\u00a0</strong>\u2013 a 2D side-view microbial\u00a0<strong>&quot;City&quot; Builder</strong>\u00a0and <strong>Simulation game\u00a0</strong>where you master the art of symbiosis and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/230b5ac01fd892420bc606cf3daedb29.avif?t=1751885955\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Innovative Colony Management</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivate </strong>a thriving colony by growing diverse plants and organisms on any solid surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with basic <strong>Stem Cells</strong> that eat, grow, divide, or wither based on the food available. <strong>Differentiate </strong>them into new organisms and meet their needs to expand your colony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and manage essential <strong>resources,</strong> like protein, mineral, or DNA,<strong>\u00a0</strong>or <strong>trade </strong>them if not locally available. Balance resource management and growth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/489681efa36ccccb5c46cf41e86bb1bc.poster.avif?t=1751885955\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/489681efa36ccccb5c46cf41e86bb1bc.webm?t=1751885955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/489681efa36ccccb5c46cf41e86bb1bc.mp4?t=1751885955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay:\u00a0Explore Unique Biomes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a <strong>world map</strong> filled with distinct biomes like the Salt Barrens, Caves, Fungal Biome, Mineralized Biome, and Hydrothermal Biome, each presenting unique challenges and strategic resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt </strong>to the specific conditions of each biome, from the chill experience of the Lush Biome to the toxic threats in the Fungal Biome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with <strong>foreign organisms</strong> through appeasing or antagonizing approaches, affecting their stance and your colony's strategy. Are they a threat to eliminate or an ally to trade with?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/9da03bb13a0afa9fcfabf35841700b8e.poster.avif?t=1751885955\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/9da03bb13a0afa9fcfabf35841700b8e.webm?t=1751885955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/9da03bb13a0afa9fcfabf35841700b8e.mp4?t=1751885955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill Vibes and Colorful Visuals with Progression and Replayability</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a <strong>beautiful alien world</strong> with vibrant, biology-inspired visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pursue\u00a0<strong>multiple paths</strong> to success, whether through peaceful symbiosis or aggressive expansion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/62e23b7ce1f41e09d3b473692132b1e5.poster.avif?t=1751885955\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/62e23b7ce1f41e09d3b473692132b1e5.webm?t=1751885955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/62e23b7ce1f41e09d3b473692132b1e5.mp4?t=1751885955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Highlights:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The demo offers ~2 hours of gameplay</strong>, introducing the core concepts of Primordial Empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a series of <strong>guided tutorial</strong> levels to learn the basics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your tiny inhabitants: cultivate <strong>19 unique plants and 5 mobile cells</strong>, explore your surroundings, gather resources, and manage production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle an <strong>open demo scenario</strong> with increasingly challenging objectives. How big and vibrant can your colony become?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/3f8298e04f2674255f140aebac24aee6.poster.avif?t=1751885955\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/3f8298e04f2674255f140aebac24aee6.webm?t=1751885955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/3f8298e04f2674255f140aebac24aee6.mp4?t=1751885955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Road map:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is not feature-complete. Here's a glimpse of what's coming in the full game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More creatures, more colors, more variety!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World map with game progression:</strong> Build colonies in different biomes, each offering unique strategic resources.\u00a0Complete goals in each colony to <strong>unlock </strong>new organisms and game mechanics, allowing for better colonies and more complex strategies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade:</strong> Establish resource-specialized colonies and later import those resources to cultivate increasingly powerful colonies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colony defense:</strong> Protect your creations from invading organisms and spreading viruses. Trace threats back to their source and eliminate them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature evolution:</strong> Mutate and adapt your organisms to thrive in diverse environments.\u00a0Use your upgraded organisms to tackle new, more challenging goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-procedural biomes:</strong> Explore a large selection of hand-crafted terrains, dynamically populated with goodies and challenges, offering a fresh experience with every replay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to dive deeper? <strong>Wishlist</strong> the full game to stay updated and experience Primordial Empire in its entirety!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/2f3be782dae95a0dbed27b758e4272a2.poster.avif?t=1751885955\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/2f3be782dae95a0dbed27b758e4272a2.webm?t=1751885955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/2f3be782dae95a0dbed27b758e4272a2.mp4?t=1751885955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
