/strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is not feature-complete. Here's a glimpse of what's coming in the full game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More creatures, more colors, more variety!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World map with game progression:</strong> Build colonies in different biomes, each offering unique strategic resources.\u00a0Complete goals in each colony to <strong>unlock </strong>new organisms and game mechanics, allowing for better colonies and more complex strategies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade:</strong> Establish resource-specialized colonies and later import those resources to cultivate increasingly powerful colonies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colony defense:</strong> Protect your creations from invading organisms and spreading viruses. Trace threats back to their source and eliminate them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature evolution:</strong> Mutate and adapt your organisms to thrive in diverse environments.\u00a0Use your upgraded organisms to tackle new, more challenging goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-procedural biomes:</strong> Explore a large selection of hand-crafted terrains, dynamically populated with goodies and challenges, offering a fresh experience with every replay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to dive deeper? <strong>Wishlist</strong> the full game to stay updated and experience Primordial Empire in its entirety!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/2f3be782dae95a0dbed27b758e4272a2.poster.avif?t=1751885955\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450780/extras/2f3be782dae95a0dbed27b758e4272a2.webm?t=1751885955\" type=\"video/web